[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
To initialize a new Gerrit site, run as the %%GERRIT_USER%% user:

  su -m %%GERRIT_USER%% -c "%%JAVA_HOME%%/bin/java -jar %%DATADIR%%/gerrit.war init -d %%GERRIT_HOME%% --no-auto-start"

The --no-auto-start flag keeps init from launching Gerrit outside of
rc(8). Then enable and start the service:

  sysrc gerrit_enable=YES
  service gerrit start

Gerrit defaults to listening on http://*:8080 for HTTP and port 29418 for SSH.

More information: https://gerrit-documentation.storage.googleapis.com/Documentation/%%PORTVERSION%%/install.html
EOM
}
{ type: upgrade
  maximum_version: "3.15.0"
  message: <<EOM
Gerrit 3.15 requires Java 25 and migrates the site schema and the
changes index.  Before starting the service, run:

  service gerrit stop
  su -m %%GERRIT_USER%% -c "%%JAVA_HOME%%/bin/java -jar %%DATADIR%%/gerrit.war init --batch -d %%GERRIT_HOME%% --no-auto-start"
  su -m %%GERRIT_USER%% -c "%%JAVA_HOME%%/bin/java -jar %%DATADIR%%/gerrit.war reindex --index changes -d %%GERRIT_HOME%%"
  service gerrit start

If gerrit_java_home is set in rc.conf, point it at a Java 25 runtime.
See https://www.gerritcodereview.com/3.15.html for behavior changes.
EOM
}
]
